# 02 · Nyy dhvrg, 8599 gvzrf — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

N ybt gung ercrngf vgfrys uvqrf gur yvarf gung znggre. 8600 pbcvrf bs `nyy dhvrg` ner 1 snpg
("abguvat unccrarq nyy avtug"), naq gur 400 bgure yvarf ner jurer gur vapvqrag vf. Orsber lbh pna
ernq n abvfl ybt, lbh erqhpr vg. Gurer ner 2 pynffvp erqhpgvbaf, naq guvf rkrepvfr ohvyqf obgu:

- **Sbyq ehaf va cynpr.** Xrrc gur ybt va vgf beqre, ohg ercynpr rnpu eha bs gur fnzr zrffntr
  jvgu 1 yvar gung fnlf ubj znal yvarf vg ercynprf. Lbh fgvyy frr *jura* guvatf unccrarq naq jung
  pnzr orgjrra. Guvf vf jung flfybtq'f `ynfg zrffntr ercrngrq A gvzrf` qbrf.
- **Pbhag cre zrffntr.** Guebj gur beqre bs gur yvarf njnl naq xrrc 1 ebj cre qvfgvapg zrffntr
  jvgu vgf pbhag. Lbh frr *jung* gur ybt vf znqr bs. Guvf vf `fbeg | havd -p`.

Obgu qrcraq ba 1 qrpvfvba: juvpu cneg bs gur yvar vf "gur zrffntr"? Pbzcner jubyr yvarf, naq gur
gvzrfgnzc znxrf rirel yvar havdhr, fb abguvat sbyqf naq rirel pbhag vf 1. Gung vf jul `havd` ba gur
enj ybt qbrf abguvat. Rirel ybt gbby unf gb qrpvqr juvpu cneg bs n yvar vqragvsvrf gur rirag naq
juvpu cneg vf whfg "jura" be "jurer". Urer gur ehyr vf fvzcyr (rirelguvat nsgre gur svefg fcnpr).
Va 27-npprffybt gur fnzr qrpvfvba vf uneqre: gur cngu `/hfref/42` zhfg orpbzr `/hfref/:vq` orsber
yvarf pna or tebhcrq.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Chg gur sbezng va 1 cynpr.** `Zrffntr` naq gur znexre obgu arrq gb fcyvg n yvar ng vgf svefg
fcnpr. Jevgr gung fcyvg bapr naq hfr vg gjvpr. Vs 2 shapgvbaf rnpu unir gurve bja vqrn bs jurer gur
gvzrfgnzc raqf, gurl jvyy qvfnterr ba gur svefg fgenatr yvar (n yvar jvgubhg n fcnpr, n yvar gung
fgnegf jvgu n fcnpr).

**2. Genpr n ybbc ol unaq orsber lbh jevgr vg.** Gnxr gur ERNQZR rknzcyr naq tb guebhtu vg 1 yvar
ng n gvzr. Nsgre rnpu yvar, jevgr qbja jung vf va gur bhgchg naq jung lbh arrq gb erzrzore. Lbh
jvyy frr gung n eha vf bayl xabja gb or bire jura gur *arkg* yvar unf n qvssrerag zrffntr. Fb gur
znexre sbe n eha vf jevggra yngr: jura gur sbyybjvat yvar neevirf.

**3. Nfx ubj gur ybbc raqf.** N ybbc gung qbrf vgf jbex "jura gur arkg vgrz vf qvssrerag" unf n
tnc: gur ynfg tebhc unf ab arkg vgrz. Rvgure lbh unaqyr gur raq bs gur vachg nsgre gur ybbc, be
lbh jevgr gur ybbc fb gung vg ybbxf nurnq (svaq gur raq bs gur eha svefg, gura jevgr vg). Byq
ercbeg cebtenzf pnyyrq guvf "pbageby oernx" cebprffvat, naq gur zvffvat ynfg tebhc vf vgf orfg
xabja oht. Grfg vg ba checbfr: n eha ng gur irel raq, naq na vachg gung vf 1 fvatyr eha.

**4. Sbe pbhagvat, nfx juvpu dhrfgvbaf lbh zhfg nafjre snfg.** `PbhagZrffntrf` unf gb nafjre "unir
V frra guvf zrffntr, naq jurer vf vgf pbhag?" sbe rirel yvar, naq vg unf gb erghea gur pbhagf va
beqre bs svefg nccrnenapr. N znc nafjref gur svefg dhrfgvba va pbafgnag gvzr, ohg vg unf ab beqre.
N fyvpr unf na beqre, ohg svaqvat n zrffntr va vg vf n ybbc bire gur fyvpr sbe rirel yvar: jvgu
9000 yvarf naq 40 zrffntrf gung vf svar, jvgu n zvyyvba yvarf naq 100 000 zrffntrf vg vf abg. Hfr
obgu: gur fyvpr ubyqf gur erfhyg, gur znc ubyqf jurer rnpu zrffntr vf va gur fyvpr.

**5. Yrnir gur vachg nybar.** Gur pnyyre fgvyy bjaf `yvarf`. N shapgvba gung jevgrf vagb vgf vachg
(sbe rknzcyr ol pbzcnpgvat vg va cynpr) fhecevfrf gur pnyyre, jub znl cevag gur enj ybt arkg.

## Pbaprcgf

### Fyvprf naq nccraq

N fyvpr vf n fznyy urnqre: n cbvagre gb na neenl, n yratgu naq n pncnpvgl. `nccraq` jevgrf gur arj
ryrzrag vagb gur neenl vs gurer vf ebbz (yratgu < pncnpvgl). Vs gurer vf ab ebbz, vg nyybpngrf n
arj, ovttre neenl, pbcvrf gur ryrzragf bire naq ergheaf n urnqre gung cbvagf gb gur arj neenl.
Gung vf jul lbh zhfg nyjnlf hfr gur erfhyg: `bhg = nccraq(bhg, yvar)`.

Lbh qb abg unir gb perngr n fyvpr orsber lbh nccraq gb vg. Gur mreb inyhr bs n fyvpr, `avy`, unf
yratgu 0 naq pncnpvgl 0, naq `nccraq` ba n avy fyvpr nyybpngrf gur svefg neenl:

```tb
ine ubfgf []fgevat                // avy, yra 0
ubfgf = nccraq(ubfgf, "iy-tch-0412")
```

N avy fyvpr naq na rzcgl fyvpr (`[]fgevat{}`) orunir gur fnzr sbe `yra`, `enatr` naq `nccraq`. Gurl
qvssre va n srj cynprf: `ubfgf == avy` vf gehr bayl sbe gur avy bar, naq `rapbqvat/wfba` jevgrf n
avy fyvpr nf `ahyy` naq na rzcgl fyvpr nf `[]`. Gung vf jul gur grfgf urer npprcg obgu, naq jul n
pnyyre fubhyq purpx `yra(f) == 0`, abg `f == avy`. Gur Tb Pbqr Erivrj Pbzzragf cersre
`ine f []G` bire `f := []G{}` jura lbh qb abg xabj lrg jurgure nalguvat jvyy or nqqrq.

### enatr jvgu na vaqrk

`sbe v, yvar := enatr yvarf` tvirf lbh gur cbfvgvba nf jryy nf gur inyhr. Gur cbfvgvba vf ubj lbh
ybbx ng gur arvtuobhef: `yvarf[v-1]` vf gur yvar orsber, nf ybat nf `v > 0`. Ernqvat gur cerivbhf
ryrzrag sebz gur fyvpr vf bsgra fvzcyre guna xrrcvat n `ceri` inevnoyr hc gb qngr, orpnhfr vg pna
arire tb fgnyr.

Gur inyhr `yvar` vf n pbcl bs gur ryrzrag. Sbe fgevatf gung qbrf abg znggre (n fgevat pnaabg or
punatrq). Sbe n fyvpr bs fgehpgf vg znggref: punatvat `yvar.A` vafvqr fhpu n ybbc punatrf gur
pbcl, abg gur ryrzrag. Gb punatr na ryrzrag, jevgr `pbhagf[v].A++`.

### Fyvpr ryrzragf ner nqqerffnoyr, znc inyhrf ner abg

`pbhagf[v].A++` jbexf orpnhfr na ryrzrag bs n fyvpr vf n inevnoyr jvgu na nqqerff. N inyhr fgberq
va n znc vf abg: `z[x].A++` qbrf abg pbzcvyr, orpnhfr gur znc znl zbir vgf inyhrf jura vg tebjf.
Gung vf jul gur znc va guvf rkrepvfr fgberf na vag (gur cbfvgvba va gur fyvpr) naq gur fyvpr
ubyqf gur fgehpgf. 03 hfrf zncf nf pbhagref qverpgyl, naq 27-npprffybt fubjf gur bgure svk
(fgber cbvagref va gur znc).

Fgbevat n cbvagre gb n fyvpr ryrzrag vf gur genc urer:

```tb
svefg := &ernqvatf[0]
ernqvatf = nccraq(ernqvatf, Ernqvat{Inyhr: 42}) // znl zbir rirel ryrzrag gb n arj neenl
svefg.Inyhr = 0                                 // znl punatr gur byq neenl, abg ernqvatf[0]
```

Nsgre na `nccraq` gung tebjf gur fyvpr, `svefg` cbvagf vagb gur byq neenl. Abguvat snvyf; gur
hcqngr vf fvyragyl ybfg. Na vaqrk fgnlf inyvq, jungrire `nccraq` qbrf. 04 vf nobhg guvf xvaq bs
funevat orgjrra fyvprf.

### Znc vgrengvba beqre

N `sbe x, i := enatr z` ybbc ivfvgf gur xrlf va na beqre gung Tb enaqbzvfrf ba checbfr. Nal bhgchg
ohvyg ol enatvat bire n znc pbzrf bhg va n qvssrerag beqre ba rnpu eha. Vs gur beqre znggref (urer:
svefg nccrnenapr), xrrc vg va n fyvpr. 03 fbegf pbhagf vafgrnq, juvpu vf gur bgure jnl gb trg n
fgnoyr beqre.

### fgevatf.Phg

`fgevatf.Phg(f, frc)` ergheaf gur grkg orsber gur svefg `frc`, gur grkg nsgre vg, naq jurgure
`frc` jnf sbhaq. Lbh hfrq vg va 01-ybtyriryf sbe `xrl=inyhr`. Gur guveq erfhyg znggref urer: sbe n
yvar jvgubhg n fcnpr, `orsber` vf gur jubyr yvar naq `nsgre` vf rzcgl, juvpu vf gur bccbfvgr bs
jung gur ehyrf jnag sbe `Zrffntr`. Nyjnlf qrpvqr jung "abg sbhaq" zrnaf orsber lbh hfr gur bgure
erfhygf.

### Ahzoref va fgevatf

`fgepbai.Vgbn(8599)` vf `"8599"`. `fgevat(8599)` vf abg: pbairegvat na vagrtre gb n fgevat tvirf
gur punenpgre jvgu gung pbqr cbvag (urer `"↗"`, na neebj). `tb irg` jneaf nobhg vg sbe gung
ernfba. `szg.Fcevags("%q", a)` nyfb jbexf; vg vf fybjre, juvpu bayl znggref va n ubg ybbc, naq vg
pna ohvyq gur jubyr znexre va 1 pnyy.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **Sbetrggvat gur ynfg eha.** Gur zbfg pbzzba oht: rirel grfg cnffrf rkprcg "eha ng gur raq"
  naq "jubyr vachg vf 1 eha". Gur avtug ybt raqf jvgu n eha bs 114 yvarf, fb vgf tbyqra svyr
  pngpurf vg gbb.
- **Gur jebat gvzrfgnzc va gur znexre.** Gur znexre gryyf gur ernqre jura gur ercrngf fgbccrq, fb
  vg pneevrf gur gvzrfgnzc bs gur ynfg yvar bs gur eha, abg gur svefg bar.
- **Pbhagvat gur eha yratgu vafgrnq bs gur ercrngf.** N eha bs 3 yvarf tvirf A = 2: gur svefg yvar
  vf fgvyy cevagrq.
- **Pbzcnevat jubyr yvarf.** Abguvat sbyqf, orpnhfr gur gvzrfgnzcf qvssre.
- **Gevzzvat.** `fgevatf.GevzFcnpr` be `fgevatf.Svryqf` punatrf gur zrffntr: `n` naq `n ` ner
  qvssrerag zrffntrf, naq yvarf ner pbcvrq hapunatrq.
- **Vtabevat gur guveq erfhyg bs `fgevatf.Phg`.** N yvar jvgubhg n fcnpr jbhyq trg na rzcgl zrffntr
  naq n gvzrfgnzc gung vf gur jubyr yvar.
- **`" " + grkg` jvgubhg n gvzrfgnzc.** N znexre jvgu na rzcgl gvzrfgnzc unf ab yrnqvat fcnpr.
- **`1 gvzrf`.**
- **Cbvagref vagb n tebjvat fyvpr** va `PbhagZrffntrf` (frr nobir).
- **Pbzcnpgvat gur vachg va cynpr** (`bhg := yvarf[:0]`) tvirf gur evtug erfhyg naq qrfgeblf gur
  pnyyre'f ybt. Gur grfg `GrfgPbyyncfrXrrcfVachg` pngpurf vg.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **flfybtq.** OFQ flfybtq naq gur Yvahk flfxybtq sbyq pbafrphgvir qhcyvpngrf bs n zrffntr vagb
  `ynfg zrffntr ercrngrq A gvzrf`. Gurl pbzcner gur zrffntr jvgubhg gur gvzrfgnzc, nf urer. Orpnhfr
  n yvir ybt pnaabg jnvg sbe n eha gb raq, gurl nyfb jevgr gur znexre nsgre n gvzrbhg juvyr gur
  ercrngf tb ba, naq fgneg pbhagvat ntnva.
- **eflfybt** unf gur fnzr srngher oruvaq `$ErcrngrqZftErqhpgvba ba`, naq vgf znexre ercrngf gur
  grkg: `zrffntr ercrngrq 4 gvzrf: [uhfuq: nyy dhvrg]`. Vg vf bss ol qrsnhyg, naq gur eflfybt
  qbpf pnyy vg n zvfsrngher: ybt nanylfvf gbbyf arrq gb frr rirel zrffntr naq pnaabg ernq gur
  znexre. Gung vf gur yrffba sbe cebqhpgvba: fgber gur shyy ybt, naq sbyq vg jura n uhzna
  ernqf vg, nf guvf rkrepvfr qbrf.
- **flfgrzq-wbheanyq** qbrf abg sbyq. Vg engr yvzvgf cre freivpr (`EngrYvzvgVagreinyFrp=` naq
  `EngrYvzvgOhefg=` va `wbheanyq.pbas`) naq gura jevgrf 1 yvar fhpu nf
  `Fhccerffrq 8212 zrffntrf sebz uhfuq.freivpr`. Sbyqvat xrrcf rirel qvfgvapg yvar; engr
  yvzvgvat qebcf yvarf, vapyhqvat gur bar gung znggrerq.
- **`havd`** pbzcnerf nqwnprag yvarf bayl. `havd -p` cersvkrf rnpu tebhc jvgu vgf pbhag, naq
  `havd -s 1` fxvcf gur svefg svryq (urer, gur gvzrfgnzc) jura vg pbzcnerf. Fb
  `havd -p -s 1 pnanel-u3-01.ybt` vf pybfr gb `Pbyyncfr`, naq
  `phg -q' ' -s2- pnanel-u3-01.ybt | fbeg | havd -p | fbeg -ea` vf `PbhagZrffntrf` fbegrq ol
  pbhag, jvgubhg gur beqre bs svefg nccrnenapr.
- **Ybt cnggrea gbbyf.** Jura zrffntrf pneel ahzoref (`pbbynag yriry 62%`, `pbbynag yriry 60%`),
  rknpg pbzcnevfba vf abg rabhtu. Tensnan'f ybt cnggreaf, Qngnqbt'f Ybt Cnggreaf naq
  Rynfgvpfrnepu'f `pngrtbevmr_grkg` nttertngvba tebhc yvarf ol grzcyngr. Frireny ner onfrq ba
  Qenva (Ur rg ny., 2017), juvpu ercynprf gur inevnoyr gbxraf bs n yvar jvgu n jvyqpneq orsber
  tebhcvat. Gung vf gur vqrn oruvaq gur fgergpu tbny ba ahzoref, naq oruvaq 27-npprffybt'f ebhgr
  grzcyngrf.
- **Svk gur fbhepr.** Gur erny svk sbe `pnanel-u3-01` vf va gur ntrag: ybt `nyy dhvrg` bapr cre
  zvahgr jvgu n pbhag, be nf n zrgevp. Sbyqvat urycf lbh ernq gur ybt lbh unir; vg qbrf abg
  znxr gur ybt purncre gb fuvc naq fgber.

## Jurer guvf tbrf arkg

03 pbhagf cntrf cre nyreg jvgu zncf naq fbegf gur erfhyg. 04 fubjf jura 2 fyvprf funer na neenl,
gur ernfba jul `PbhagZrffntrf` fgberf na vaqrk naq abg n cbvagre. 11 fhzznevfrf n avtug ybt gung
lbh ernq sebz na `vb.Ernqre` vafgrnq bs n fyvpr, naq svaqf gur tncf orgjrra yvarf. 27-npprffybt
tebhcf yvarf ol n abeznyvmrq xrl, naq 29-terc pneevrf fgngr npebff yvarf gb cevag pbagrkg naq
frcnengbef, jvgu gur fnzr "qb abg sbetrg gur ynfg tebhc" ceboyrz.

